  - Bouncy Castle bcprov-jdk15to18 1.81: Bouncy Castle Licence (MIT-style);
    https://www.bouncycastle.org/licence.html
  - Conscrypt 2.5.3: Apache-2.0; https://github.com/google/conscrypt
